<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: GOLF-FINAL SCORES FROM RAIN-SHORTENED MEMORIAL TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL SCORES FROM RAIN-SHORTENED MEMORIAL TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN, Ohio 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the</p>
<p>final round of the rain-shortened $1.9 million Memorial</p>
<p>Tournament (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>202 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 70 65 67</p>
<p>204 Greg Norman (Australia) 71 69 64, Jim Furyk 71 66 67</p>
<p>205 Lee Janzen 70 67 68, Scott Hoch 67 65 73, Tommy Tolles 70</p>
<p>64 71</p>
<p>206 Frank Nobilo (New Zealand) 71 67 68</p>
<p>208 Jack Nicklaus 69 70 69, Tim Herron 66 72 70</p>
<p>209 Davis Love 70 71 68, Bob Tway 74 66 69, Glen Day 66 74</p>
<p>69, Billy Andrade 66 72 71</p>
<p>210 Mark Calcavecchia 73 70 67, Donnie Hammond 72 71 67, Guy</p>
<p>Boros 68 68 74</p>
<p>211 Billy Mayfair 69 74 68, David Frost (South Africa) 72 70</p>
<p>69, David Duval 73 69 69, Peter Jacobsen 71 71 69</p>
<p>Add non-U.S. scores:</p>
<p>212 Jesper Parnevik (Sweden) 66 73 73</p>
